# alt_recenter_gate.expect — re-center gate + symmetric climb/descend (Case A)
# 再センターゲート＋対称な上昇/降下（Case A）
#
# D [12.0,14.0]: gate CLOSED — throttle held UP (4095) is IGNORED, altitude holds ~0.5 m
#   (alt_max < 0.72). Without the gate, full-up would carry it away.
# F [17.5,18.5]: after re-centering at E the gate OPENS; throttle UP now CLIMBs (> 1.1 m).
# G [20.5,21.0]: throttle DOWN now DESCENDs — the new symmetric scheme lowers the target
#   altitude back below 0.9 m (the stick controls both directions, centre = hold).
# D [12.0,14.0]: ゲート閉 — 上げっぱなし(4095)は無視され ~0.5 m 保持(alt_max < 0.72)。
# F [17.5,18.5]: E で再センター後ゲート開、上げで上昇(> 1.1 m)。
# G [20.5,21.0]: 下げで降下 — 対称方式で目標高度を 0.9 m 未満へ下げる（中央=ホールド）。
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
# Gate CLOSED: throttle UP ignored → hold the captured 0.5 m.
metric alt_max  < 0.72 in 12.0 14.0
metric alt_band < 0.20 in 12.0 14.0
# Gate OPEN + UP: climb well above 0.5 m.
metric alt_max  > 1.10 in 17.5 18.5
# DOWN: descend back below 0.9 m (symmetric stick — new descend capability).
metric alt_mean < 0.90 in 20.5 21.0
metric tilt_max < 10.0 in 9.0 23.0
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 12.0 23.0
